--- Part 1 Establishing Company 
The project was started by creating a Doc and using Claude to generate some ideas for the company profile. 
Next up was using information from https://www.pmi.org/learning/library/project-risk-management-success-tool-6078 to put together what information
was needed to support the risk register and project as a whole. 

---- Part 2 Generating Risk Register 
Using Sheets to create the risk register template with the following categories:
- Risk ID
- Category
- Risk brief
- Likelihood [1-5]
- Impact [1-5]
- Score [L x I]
- Rating [C/H/M/L]
- Mitigation form link

---- Part 3 Implementing EntreID
Use Claude to generate 50 random employees. Use Sheets to store names and download as CSV. 
Add all employees as users into Azure EntreID including the following:
- Principal name for email (first initial, last name)
- Display name (first and last name)
- Job title
- Department 
- Employee ID
- Group

---- Part 4
Created a Drive file for the project that includes:
- Main project overview for mock company 
- Sheet for the risk register that acts as a summary for each risk 
- Risk Mitigation template that is used to document and track each risk 
A seperate folder contains the risk mitigation forms for each risk and risk category 

